# .dockerignore — repo root: the bouncer at COPY's door. ONE file guards EVERY image
# (vsu-api, vsu-ui) because the build context is always the repo root.
# history & secrets — never in an image
.git
**/.env*
# pipeline & IDE files — images run apps, not pipelines or editors
.github
.vs
.vscode
.idea
# local build junk — the image builds fresh; stale local outputs stay out
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
# docs — readable on GitHub, dead weight in an image
**/*.md
